etired from sports and went back to his village.","The Olympics has bequeathed to the world thrilling examples of courage (sprinter Gail Davers battling an almost fatal thyroid condition; wrestler Jeff Blatnick overcoming Hodgkin’s disease), of determination and astonishing physical grace. And should the Games last another 100 years, there will always be heroes to cheer. Nike! Nike!","The Greek word Nike means {{0}} in English.","The first modern Olympiad was held in Greece, but the very first event was won by an {{1}}.","Unlike in present-day Olympics, winners received a {{2}} medal then.","James Connolly never completed his {{3}}.","After his Olympic victory he became a journalist, and he also {{4}}.","Only {{5}} different nationalities took part in the first modern Olympics.","All the 300 participants were {{6}}."],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient","caseSensitive":false},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"accept":["victory"]},{"n":1,"accept":["American"]},{"n":2,"accept":["silver"]},{"n":3,"accept":["Harvard studies","university studies","studies","university education","degree"]},{"n":4,"accept":["wrote novels","wrote books","wrote fiction"]},{"n":5,"accept":["13","a few"]},{"n":6,"accept":["amateurs"]}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2005-maj-emelt-R2$mtr$, $mtr$2005-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$reading$mtr$, 2, $mtr$bank$mtr$, $mtr$mondat visszahelyezése szövegbe$mtr$, 7, 2, $mtr${"id":"2005-maj-emelt-R2","number":2,"kind":"bank","layout":"inline","examType":"mondat visszahelyezése szövegbe","points":7,"instructions":["Read the following advice on how to behave on your first day at work.","Parts of some sentences are missing.","Your task is to fill them in from the list below.","Remember that there are two extra letters that you do not need."],"title":"THE DO’S AND DON’T’S","body":["DO","→ Turn up at the right time on the right day, and preferably at the right address – first {{0}}.","→ Consider whether it {{7}} to leave your nose stud and ear-piercings at home.","→ Be nice to everyone, including the man you like least. He {{8}}.","→ Ask questions (but not: “Why is it my {{9}}?”)","DON’T","→ Say that the senior partner is your dad’s best friend and will {{10}}.","→ Start surfing dodgy websites on the office computer {{11}} for you to do.","→ Tell the secretaries you’ll {{12}} within a year of graduating from Oxford.","→ Write an e-mail to a friend saying you are surrounded by {{13}} accidentally send it to “all company users.”"],"bank":[{"key":"A","text":"be earning far more than them"},{"key":"B","text":"is expected to do the dirty work"},{"key":"C","text":"impressions can last a long time"},{"key":"D","text":"sack anyone who crosses you"},{"key":"E","text":"turn to make the tea again"},{"key":"F","text":"might be the chairman"},{"key":"G","text":"even if there isn’t much"},{"key":"H","text":"boring losers, and then"},{"key":"I","text":"be deeply disappointing"},{"key":"K","text":"might be best"}],"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"answer":"C"},{"n":10},{"n":7},{"n":11},{"n":8},{"n":12},{"n":9},{"n":13}]}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
