 have much time to play music"},{"key":"B","text":"nobody spoke English"}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Cecily … in the camp.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"danced a lot"},{"key":"B","text":"was taught to count in Hungarian"}]},{"n":26,"stem":"Cecily decided to return to Hungary …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the following year."},{"key":"B","text":"after her graduation."}]},{"n":27,"stem":"This year, Cecily ... the Hungarian bagpipe.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"carried out a study about"},{"key":"B","text":"learnt how to play"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_06maj_fl.mp3","start":1218.37,"end":1797.3,"clip":"hang/e_angol_06maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
