rstand people who commit such crimes."},{"n":16,"stem":"There are some people who would like to rebuild the original buildings."},{"n":17,"stem":"In her opinion, it wouldn't be appropriate to put up buildings at the site where the World Trade Center used to be."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_07maj_fl.mp3","start":689.52,"end":1233.97,"clip":"hang/e_angol_07maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
