e who would like to rebuild the original buildings.","answer":"A"},{"n":17,"stem":"In her opinion, it wouldn't be appropriate to put up buildings at the site where the World Trade Center used to be.","answer":"A"}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
