t":"moved like a monkey."}],"answer":"C"},{"n":16,"stem":"Even if we can speak a language very well, we can never be sure …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"how well our partner speaks the language."},{"key":"B","text":"that other people can understand our local accent."},{"key":"C","text":"that other people can understand our message."}],"answer":"C"},{"n":17,"stem":"The role of common experiences is very clear in the case of representatives of different …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"professions."},{"key":"B","text":"cultures."},{"key":"C","text":"languages."}],"answer":"A"},{"n":18,"stem":"Communication problems may occur in the case of …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"people who share the same interests."},{"key":"B","text":"languages with a very limited vocabulary."},{"key":"C","text":"peoples who live under different geographical conditions."}],"answer":"C"},{"n":19,"stem":"If we want to communicate successfully, we must …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"have a vocabulary of more than 60 thousand words."},{"key":"B","text":"use the same words."},{"key":"C","text":"share similar experiences."}],"answer":"C"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
