{"n":39,"text":"multimillionaire. What puzzles to us is why you would bother to","answer":"to"},{"n":40,"text":"borrow $5,000.\" The businessman replies him, \"Where else in San","answer":"him"}],"outro":"Francisco can I park my car for two weeks for $15? \""}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
