tony."},{"n":18,"stem":"The findings of the research are accessible to anyone."},{"n":19,"stem":"Next year’s Mars 500 experiment will have more crew members."},{"n":20,"stem":"The next crew will spend considerably more time in the module."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_10maj_fl.mp3","start":691.88,"end":1259,"clip":"hang/e_angol_10maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
