he incident."},{"key":"C","text":"went on to do his job in wet clothes after the incident."}],"answer":"C"},{"n":5,"stem":"Last week, Keith McVey…","options":[{"key":"A","text":"heard a cry for help from a vehicle."},{"key":"B","text":"saw an unconscious man lying by the side of the road."},{"key":"C","text":"saw a truck driver lose consciousness."}],"answer":"A"},{"n":6,"stem":"Keith McVey …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"didn’t know anything about CPR."},{"key":"B","text":"performed CPR on the man with the help of a woman."},{"key":"C","text":"helped a woman who performed CPR on the man."}],"answer":"B"},{"n":7,"stem":"Keith McVey …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"felt pain in his shoulders after the incident."},{"key":"B","text":"almost decided to go home after the ambulance left."},{"key":"C","text":"didn’t want his colleagues to do him a favour."}],"answer":"C"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
