ied out in San Jose.","answer":"C"},{"n":11,"stem":"Most probably, Beethoven suffered from lead poisoning.","answer":"A"},{"n":12,"stem":"There is hardly any doubt that the composer’s deafness was caused by “plumbism”.","answer":"B"}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
