ory News. The paper was reported","answer":"was"},{"n":40,"text":"a similar extraordinary phenomena in 1974 and 2004.","answer":"a"}],"outro":"(www.telegraph.co.uk)"}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2013-maj-emelt-H1$mtr$, $mtr$2013-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 1, $mtr$choice$mtr$, $mtr$igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)$mtr$, 11, 9, $mtr${"id":"2013-maj-emelt-H1","number":1,"kind":"choice","layout":"stems","examType":"igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)","points":11,"instructions":["In this section you will hear a story about Ernest Dittemore, who lives in a hole in the ground.","Your task will be to decide whether the following statements are true, false or we do not know because the text does not say, and write the appropriate letter in the boxes on the right. Write A if the statement is true, write B if the statement is false, and write C if the text does not say.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_13maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":604.57,"clip":"hang/e_angol_13maj_fl_H1.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The population of Troy, Missouri is 1,250.","answer":"A"},{"n":1,"stem":"Ernest is in his early 70s."},{"n":2,"stem":"Someone deliberately set fire to Ernest’s house."},{"n":3,"stem":"Ernest spent the first night after the fire in the trailer house."},{"n":4,"stem":"Now he only uses the trailer to keep things in."},{"n":5,"stem":"His bed is made from newspapers."},{"n":6,"stem":"There’s complete darkness in the hole, even in broad daylight."},{"n":7,"stem":"Ernest’s hole is 7 meters deep."},{"n":8,"stem":"Ernest spends the day looking after his animals."},{"n":9,"stem":"Ernest usually finishes his evening meal with some dessert."},{"n":10,"stem":"Ernest wants to hide away from the real world."},{"n":11,"stem":"His relatives and friends often visit him in his home."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_13maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":604.57,"clip":"hang/e_angol_13maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
