uscle activity.","gaps":[["brain"],["signals"]]},{"n":18,"stem":"It’s been confirmed that all {{gap}} and {{gap}} studied with the EEG do actually sleep.","unordered":true,"gaps":[["birds"],["mammals"]]},{"n":19,"stem":"At the same time, however, there is some {{gap}} that {{gap}}, such as snakes and turtles do not truly sleep.","gaps":[["evidence"],["reptiles"]]},{"n":20,"stem":"Good sleepers are nearly all {{gap}}, while poor sleepers are animals that are prey for predators, so they must be watching out for {{gap}}.","gaps":[["hunters"],["enemies"]]}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient","caseSensitive":false,"note":"Csak akkor adható pont, ha MINDKETTŐ szó elfogadható!"}}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
