 secret that they shouldn’t speak about."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"This service …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"will be offered six more times."},{"key":"B","text":"won’t be offered again."},{"key":"C","text":"might be offered again in the future."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Compared to most countries, Denmark has … birthrate.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"a higher"},{"key":"B","text":"a lower"},{"key":"C","text":"an average"}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Ms Nyman thinks that the local government will give nurseries … money.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the same amount of"},{"key":"B","text":"more"},{"key":"C","text":"less"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_13maj_fl.mp3","start":1152.58,"end":1792.68,"clip":"hang/k_angol_13maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
