e idea of the stunt after watching a film starring Tom Cruise."}]},{"n":16,"stem":"Back on the ground, the Prince said that the …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"hardest part was the ten-flight walk to the 87th floor."},{"key":"B","text":"most frightening bit was the very first step over the edge."}]},{"n":17,"stem":"The climbers eventually …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"landed on the 20th floor of the skyscraper."},{"key":"B","text":"walked down to the ground floor of the skyscraper."}]},{"n":18,"stem":"Prince Andrew’s stunt is not likely to happen again, because …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the authorities are not going to allow it."},{"key":"B","text":"he said he is not going to repeat it."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_14okt_fl.mp3","start":714.23,"end":1171.41,"clip":"hang/e_angol_14okt_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
