as a different situation.","gapCount":2},{"n":26,"stem":"He thinks that studying with John Abercrombie was a major {{gap}} {{gap}} in his musical life.","gapCount":2},{"n":27,"stem":"He describes himself as someone who follows his {{gap}} {{gap}} above anything else.","gapCount":2},{"n":28,"stem":"He sees himself as a(n) {{gap}} {{gap}} and a goofy, up-beat person at the same time.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_14okt_fl.mp3","start":1171.41,"end":1794.93,"clip":"hang/e_angol_14okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
