g themselves by allowing both {{gap}} and {{gap}} to feed seagulls.","gapCount":2},{"n":28,"stem":"Mr Flaherty says that other coastal areas have laws made by {{gap}} {{gap}} preventing people from feeding birds.","gapCount":2},{"n":29,"stem":"Mr Flaherty finds it horrendous that there is poo all over the {{gap}} and all over {{gap}} and he thinks that these birds are scavangers.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_15maj_fl.mp3","start":1192.42,"end":1793.99,"clip":"hang/e_angol_15maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
