publishers and artists."},{"key":"B","text":"helped to set a new fashion in book publishing."}]},{"n":5,"stem":"One publisher says that colouring books are so popular that they have …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"come out with several editions of some of their books."},{"key":"B","text":"sold 60,000 copies of their best-selling book."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"Ms Blatherwick says that at first they didn’t realize that the books would become so …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"attractive."},{"key":"B","text":"popular."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"According to the speaker, colouring books for adults provide an opportunity to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"spend their free time truly creatively."},{"key":"B","text":"think and calm the mind."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_17okt_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":666.83,"clip":"hang/e_angol_17okt_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
