 because they had different opinions on art."},{"key":"B","text":"became involved in a lot of fierce arguments."}],"answer":["B"]},{"n":5,"stem":"Van Gogh got so angry with Gauguin that he …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"attacked him."},{"key":"B","text":"cut off his friend’s earlobe."}],"answer":["A"]},{"n":6,"stem":"Self Portrait with Bandaged Ear …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"was painted the day after the terrible incident."},{"key":"B","text":"doesn't actually show the ear that was injured."}],"answer":["B"]},{"n":7,"stem":"Van Gogh’s two biographers think that he painted this picture to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"show that he was mentally stable."},{"key":"B","text":"avoid being taken to a madhouse."}],"answer":["A","B"]},{"n":8,"stem":"Van Gogh …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"was sent to hospital at the request of his neighbours."},{"key":"B","text":"finally agreed that he should be taken to the local hospital."}],"answer":["A"]}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2018-okt-emelt-H2$mtr$, $mtr$2018-okt-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 2, $mtr$choice$mtr$, $mtr$igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)$mtr$, 9, 10, $mtr${"id":"2018-okt-emelt-H2","number":2,"kind":"choice","layout":"stems","examType":"igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)","points":9,"instructions":["In this section you will hear about the spaceflight and landing of two cosmonauts, Alexei Leonov and Pavel Belyayev.","Your task will be to decide whether the following statements are true, false or we do not know because the text does not say, and write the appropriate letter in the boxes on the right. Write A if the statement is true, write B if the statement is false, and write C if the text does not say.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_18okt_fl.mp3","start":761.8,"end":1251.03,"clip":"hang/e_angol_18okt_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"It was in 1965 that Leonov completed the first spacewalk ever.","answer":"A"},{"n":9,"stem":"The original plan was that Leonov would return to the spacecraft feet first."},{"n":10,"stem":"When he was letting all the oxygen out of his suit, Leonov felt dangerously cold."},{"n":11,"stem":"It was Leonov who first noticed that the automatic guidance system wasn't working."},{"n":12,"stem":"Both cosmonauts had been properly trained in manual landing."},{"n":13,"stem":"The two cosmonauts managed to cut the communication cable."},{"n":14,"stem":"Eventually, they happened to land near the area where they had wanted to."},{"n":15,"stem":"The landing capsule was their only protection from the deep snow."},{"n":16,"stem":"In spring, bears and wolves are especially dangerous in the taiga."},{"n":17,"stem":"Luckily, the temperature wasn’t very cold during the nights the cosmonauts spent there."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_18okt_fl.mp3","start":761.8,"end":1251.03,"clip":"hang/e_angol_18okt_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
insert into public.task_keys (task_id, task) values ($mtr$2018-okt-emelt-H2$mtr$, $mtr${"id":"2018-okt-emelt-H2","number":2,"kind":"choice","layout":"stems","examType":"igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)","points":9,"instructions":["In this section you will hear about the spaceflight and landing of two cosmonauts, Alexei Leonov and Pavel Belyayev.","Your task will be to decide whether the following statements are true, false or we do not know because the text does not say, and write the appropriate letter in the boxes on the right. Write A if the statement is true, write B if the statement is false, and write C if the text does not say.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_18okt_fl.mp3","start":761.8,"end":1251.03,"clip":"hang/e_angol_18okt_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"It was in 1965 that Leonov completed the first spacewalk ever.","answer":"A"},{"n":9,"stem":"The original plan was that Leonov would return to the spacecraft feet first.","answer":"A"},{"n":10,"stem":"When he was letting all the oxygen out of his suit, Leonov felt dangerously cold.","answer":"B"},{"n":11,"stem":"It was Leonov who first noticed that the automatic guidance system wasn't working.","answer":"C"},{"n":12,"stem":"Both cosmonauts had been properly trained in manual landing.","answer":"C"},{"n":13,"stem":"The two cosmonauts managed to cut the communication cable.","answer":"B"},{"n":14,"stem":"Eventually, they happened to land near the area where they had wanted to.","answer":"B"},{"n":15,"stem":"The landing capsule was their only protection from the deep snow.","answer":"A"},{"n":16,"stem":"In spring, bears and wolves are especially dangerous in the taiga.","answer":"A"},{"n":17,"stem":"Luckily, the temperature wasn’t very cold during the nights the cosmonauts spent there.","answer":"B"}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
