"At a ‘laughing party’, Dr. Horace Wells ….","options":[{"key":"A","text":"injured his leg."},{"key":"B","text":"made an important observation."}]},{"n":13,"stem":"Dr. Wells …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"asked another dentist to inhale some ‘laughing gas’."},{"key":"B","text":"wanted to test the pain killing effect of the gas on himself."}]},{"n":14,"stem":"In Boston …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the patient fainted because of too much ‘laughing gas’."},{"key":"B","text":"Dr. Wells’ demonstration was a complete failure."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_19okt_fl.mp3","start":634.55,"end":1330.04,"clip":"hang/k_angol_19okt_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
