nt theories about how it happened. \"God created Adam and Eve and they were Ubang people,\" says the chief. \"God's plan was to give each ethnic group two languages, but after creating the two languages for the Ubang, he realised that he simply didn’t have enough languages to hand out. So he stopped,\" he explains.","\"That's why Ubang has the benefit of two languages – we are different from other people in the world.\"","(bbc.co.uk)"],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"NOT ENOUGH INFORMATION"}],"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"There is a village where the language people speak depends on their sex.","answer":"A"},{"n":14,"stem":"The chief's daughter cannot immediately give the word for cup.","answer":"B"},{"n":15,"stem":"Most of the words are the same in the male and the female language.","answer":"C"},{"n":16,"stem":"There are more male than female words in Ubang.","answer":"C"},{"n":17,"stem":"The male words are more difficult to pronounce than the female words.","answer":"C"},{"n":18,"stem":"In Ubang, a man and a woman have no more problems understanding each other than, for example, a man and a woman in the UK.","answer":"A"},{"n":19,"stem":"Boys learn the male language from their fathers.","answer":"C"},{"n":20,"stem":"According to the chief, God gave two languages to every ethnic group in the world.","answer":"B"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
