opped her because she was driving …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"without her seat-belt on."},{"key":"B","text":"too fast."},{"key":"C","text":"too slow."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"The officer …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"became very angry with the driver."},{"key":"B","text":"laughed out loud."},{"key":"C","text":"didn’t want to humiliate the driver."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"The driver … when the officer pointed out her mistake.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"got angry"},{"key":"B","text":"felt embarrassed"},{"key":"C","text":"was thankful"}]},{"n":8,"stem":"The officer wanted …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"to know how the people in the car were feeling."},{"key":"B","text":"the driver to show him her driver’s licence."},{"key":"C","text":"the driver to pay a small fine."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_20maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":645.17,"clip":"hang/k_angol_20maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
