 heavy animals were taken across it."},{"n":24,"stem":"The Brooklyn Bridge was the longest bridge in the world until the middle of the 20th century."},{"n":25,"stem":"Unfortunately, more than twenty people died while building the Brooklyn Bridge."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_20maj_fl.mp3","start":1203.35,"end":1795.53,"clip":"hang/k_angol_20maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
