","text":"knows everyone believes his lies."}]},{"n":22,"stem":"Barry once told his mum that a …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"neighbour wanted to borrow her vacuum cleaner."},{"key":"B","text":"ghost haunted the local castle."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"Barry liked reading as a child because …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the cinema was a long way away."},{"key":"B","text":"his parents also liked reading."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Barry …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"very rarely visits schools in the UK."},{"key":"B","text":"was once asked if he had ever killed anyone."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Barry’s advice to young writers is that they should …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"create their own virtual reality."},{"key":"B","text":"go outside and hang out with friends."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_20okt_fl.mp3","start":1193.32,"end":1795.69,"clip":"hang/k_angol_20okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
