here is no {{gap}} {{gap}} that it prevents colds, makes symptoms less serious or reduces the length of a cold.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_21maj_fl.mp3","start":1233.56,"end":1794.96,"clip":"hang/e_angol_21maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
