od-hearted."},{"n":8,"stem":"The monk told the second traveller that the people in the next village were rather unwelcoming."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_21okt_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":632.77,"clip":"hang/k_angol_21okt_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
