 the golf course"}]},{"n":22,"stem":"The old man asked St Peter …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"how much they had to pay for the lunch."},{"key":"B","text":"whether there was any low fat food for them."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"St Peter told them that they would never get … in heaven.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"fat"},{"key":"B","text":"ill"}]},{"n":24,"stem":"St Peter told them that they could ... if they wanted to.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"go to the gym"},{"key":"B","text":"test their sugar or blood pressure every day"}]},{"n":25,"stem":"The old man was …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"angry with his wife about all the dieting and workout."},{"key":"B","text":"sorry that they hadn’t entered heaven earlier."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_21okt_fl.mp3","start":1138.4,"end":1795.17,"clip":"hang/k_angol_21okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
