xt":"bed for a half an hour whilst she was in the shower. Then, when she"}],"outro":"walked in, I grabbed her ankles. I also chased her down the road dressed as a zombie nun. It's all been in good fun, though.\"","source":"https://www.mirror.co.uk/news/weird-news/mum-leaves-skeleton-prank-walls-24754506"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
