ons for applying."},{"key":"B","text":"details of what the applicants can expect during the voyage."}]},{"n":12,"stem":"It is a requirement that the candidate should be …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"younger than 20."},{"key":"B","text":"cheerful and optimistic at all times."}]},{"n":13,"stem":"Mr Maezawa …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"used to be a musician."},{"key":"B","text":"paid money to all the people who shared one of his tweets."}]},{"n":14,"stem":"Mr Maezawa …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"got rich as the founder of a profitable online business."},{"key":"B","text":"spends quite a lot of money on art."}]},{"n":15,"stem":"Mr Maezawa …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"paid a price for the voyage that hasn’t been made public."},{"key":"B","text":"wants to take some artists on the voyage with him as well."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_22maj_fl.mp3","start":561.45,"end":1227.58,"clip":"hang/e_angol_22maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
