e actors."},{"key":"B","text":"didn’t give many instructions to Ariana."}]},{"n":21,"stem":"In Jurassic Park, … not computer generated.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"80% of the dinosaur scenes were"},{"key":"B","text":"the scene of the T-rex with the jeep was"}]},{"n":22,"stem":"Ariana says…","options":[{"key":"A","text":"she had already become interested in dinosaurs before making the film."},{"key":"B","text":"there was a famous palaeontologist on the set much of the time."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"Jack Horner…","options":[{"key":"A","text":"was an advisor for Jurassic Park."},{"key":"B","text":"invited Ariana to Montana."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Ariana …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"was the first to discover a velociraptor arm on the ground."},{"key":"B","text":"has a velociraptor arm in her collection."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_22maj_fl.mp3","start":1165.36,"end":1795.04,"clip":"hang/k_angol_22maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
