r for Sandy."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"‘Darkness’ became the name of ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Art."},{"key":"B","text":"Sandy."},{"key":"C","text":"blindness."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"One day, Art …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"accidentally lost Sandy in a crowded place."},{"key":"B","text":"left Sandy alone because he had to hurry somewhere."},{"key":"C","text":"pretended to leave Sandy on his own."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"After the incident, Sandy was … for being left alone.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"angry"},{"key":"B","text":"disappointed"},{"key":"C","text":"grateful"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_23maj_fl.mp3","start":1190.21,"end":1795.22,"clip":"hang/k_angol_23maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
