ent with his students."},{"key":"B","text":"took the cash prize out of the locker."}]},{"n":5,"stem":"Professor Wilson said that his aim was to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"improve the mood of his students during the pandemic."},{"key":"B","text":"reward his students for reading everything in the syllabus."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"Professor Wilson said that …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"when he was a student he would certainly have fully read the document."},{"key":"B","text":"not everything was equally important in a syllabus."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"The professor had no doubt that the money had remained unclaimed because …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the lucky student would definitely have mentioned it."},{"key":"B","text":"nobody seemed to have touched the lock."}]},{"n":8,"stem":"A senior student said that …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"he felt quite stupid when he learnt about Mr. Wilson's joke."},{"key":"B","text":"it was out of character for Mr. Wilson to do something like that."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_24maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":664.87,"clip":"hang/e_angol_24maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
