a busy road."},{"n":35,"text":"Double glazing ensures noise levels inside is minimal and the road only"}],"outro":"gets really busy at morning and evening rush hours.","source":"https://www.walesonline.co.uk/news/wales-news/family-lived-middle-busy-welsh-30390475"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
insert into public.task_keys (task_id, task) values ($mtr$2025-maj-emelt-L4$mtr$, $mtr${"id":"2025-maj-emelt-L4","number":4,"kind":"lines","layout":"lines","examType":"soronkénti hibakeresés (felesleges szó vagy helyes sor)","points":10,"instructions":["You are going to read an article about a family that live in the middle of a roundabout. In most lines there is one word that should not be there. It is either grammatically incorrect or does not fit in with the sense of the text.","Read the text and then copy the extra word in the space provided after each line.","Some lines may be correct. Indicate the correct line(s) with a tick ().","The task begins with two examples (0)."],"title":"LIVING IN THE MIDDLE OF A ROUNDABOUT","intro":"","items":[{"n":"0a","example":true,"text":"It's a sight that leaves thousands of motorists scratching their heads every","answer":null},{"n":"0b","example":true,"text":"single day - a house all right in the middle of a busy Welsh roundabout.","answer":"all"},{"n":26,"text":"For more than 60 years, the property has been home as to the Howatson","answer":"as"},{"n":27,"text":"family. They moved in in 1960 and have refused to leave when Denbigh's","answer":"have"},{"n":28,"text":"new bypass was built in the late 1970s. Instead, the roundabout on Rhyl","answer":null},{"n":29,"text":"Road was built around them. The family even though have chickens living","answer":"though"},{"n":30,"text":"alongside them - with the road-crossing hens a regular on sight. The hens","answer":"on"},{"n":31,"text":"have been navigating the busy roundabout for 20 years, and only two have","answer":null},{"n":32,"text":"been killed by cars. The present owner, Clwyd Howatson, has already","answer":"already"},{"n":33,"text":"lived at the property for most of his own life. He claims that living on a","answer":"own"},{"n":34,"text":"roundabout is not too different from having both a house on a busy road.","answer":"both"},{"n":35,"text":"Double glazing ensures noise levels inside is minimal and the road only","answer":"levels"}],"outro":"gets really busy at morning and evening rush hours.","source":"https://www.walesonline.co.uk/news/wales-news/family-lived-middle-busy-welsh-30390475"}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2025-maj-emelt-H1$mtr$, $mtr$2025-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 1, $mtr$text$mtr$, $mtr$mondatkiegészítés hallás után (két szó)$mtr$, 9, 9, $mtr${"id":"2025-maj-emelt-H1","number":1,"kind":"text","layout":"stems","examType":"mondatkiegészítés hallás után (két szó)","points":9,"instructions":["In this section, you will listen to the story of the famous Kon-Tiki expedition.","Your task is to complete the sentences with two words indicated by the gaps, using the exact words you hear in the recording.","First, you will have some time to study the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_25maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":640.1,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25maj_fl_H1.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki expedition was {{gap}} {{gap}} Thor Heyerdahl.","gaps":[["led"],["by"]]},{"n":1,"stem":"The expedition tried to demonstrate that it was possible for ancient South American people to colonize Polynesia {{gap}} {{gap}} wooden rafts.","gapCount":2},{"n":2,"stem":"Heyerdahl’s team built the Kon-Tiki raft using simple {{gap}} and {{gap}} techniques.","gapCount":2},{"n":3,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki crew had to face the challenges of the crossing with limited {{gap}} and a lot of {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":4,"stem":"During the trip across the Pacific, the crew also had to face problems with the weather, such as {{gap}}, and with dangerous animals in the sea such as {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":5,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki reached the shores of the Tuamotu Islands, {{gap}} that this voyage was {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":6,"stem":"The success of the expedition led to the publication of an award winning {{gap}} and a(n) {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":7,"stem":"However, despite the success of the expedition, some {{gap}} warned that one should be extremely sceptical of Heyerdahl’s {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":8,"stem":"According to these experts, it was more likely that the {{gap}} {{gap}} was true: people from the Pacific islands populated South America.","gapCount":2},{"n":9,"stem":"Decades later, DNA {{gap}} found that Polynesians have more {{gap}} with people from South East Asia.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_25maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":640.1,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
insert into public.task_keys (task_id, task) values ($mtr$2025-maj-emelt-H1$mtr$, $mtr${"id":"2025-maj-emelt-H1","number":1,"kind":"text","layout":"stems","examType":"mondatkiegészítés hallás után (két szó)","points":9,"instructions":["In this section, you will listen to the story of the famous Kon-Tiki expedition.","Your task is to complete the sentences with two words indicated by the gaps, using the exact words you hear in the recording.","First, you will have some time to study the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_25maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":640.1,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25maj_fl_H1.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki expedition was {{gap}} {{gap}} Thor Heyerdahl.","gaps":[["led"],["by"]]},{"n":1,"stem":"The expedition tried to demonstrate that it was possible for ancient South American people to colonize Polynesia {{gap}} {{gap}} wooden rafts.","gaps":[["using"],["primitive"]]},{"n":2,"stem":"Heyerdahl’s team built the Kon-Tiki raft using simple {{gap}} and {{gap}} techniques.","gaps":[["materials"],["traditional"]]},{"n":3,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki crew had to face the challenges of the crossing with limited {{gap}} and a lot of {{gap}}.","gaps":[["resources"],["courage"]]},{"n":4,"stem":"During the trip across the Pacific, the crew also had to face problems with the weather, such as {{gap}}, and with dangerous animals in the sea such as {{gap}}.","gaps":[["storms"],["sharks"]]},{"n":5,"stem":"The Kon-Tiki reached the shores of the Tuamotu Islands, {{gap}} that this voyage was {{gap}}.","gaps":[["proving"],["possible"]]},{"n":6,"stem":"The success of the expedition led to the publication of an award winning {{gap}} and a(n) {{gap}}.","gaps":[["book"],["documentary"]]},{"n":7,"stem":"However, despite the success of the expedition, some {{gap}} warned that one should be extremely sceptical of Heyerdahl’s {{gap}}.","gaps":[["scientists"],["theories","findings"]]},{"n":8,"stem":"According to these experts, it was more likely that the {{gap}} {{gap}} was true: people from the Pacific islands populated South America.","gaps":[["exact"],["opposite"]]},{"n":9,"stem":"Decades later, DNA {{gap}} found that Polynesians have more {{gap}} with people from South East Asia.","gaps":[["tests"],["similarities"]]}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient","caseSensitive":false,"note":"(Csak az alábbi, a szövegben elhangzó szavak fogadhatók el, és csak akkor adható pont, ha mindkét szó elfogadható. A megoldásban pontosvesszővel (;) elválasztott szavak sorrendje nem cserélhető fel.)"}}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2025-maj-emelt-H2$mtr$, $mtr$2025-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 2, $mtr$multi$mtr$, $mtr$kettős választás (A, B vagy mindkettő)$mtr$, 7, 10, $mtr${"id":"2025-maj-emelt-H2","number":2,"kind":"multi","layout":"stems","examType":"kettős választás (A, B vagy mindkettő)","points":7,"instructions":["In this section, you will listen to a recording about the relationship between Mozart and Haydn.","Your task will be to circle the letter(s) of the correct answer(s) in the boxes on the right. Please note that in this task both answers may be correct. However, there is always at least one correct answer. This means you might have to circle one or two letters.","First, you will have some time to study the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_25maj_fl.mp3","start":640.1,"end":1181.83,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25maj_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"Mozart and Haydn had a relationship that was …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"both personal and professional."},{"key":"B","text":"characterized by mutual respect and admiration."}],"answer":["A","B"]},{"n":10,"stem":"Haydn ….","options":[{"key":"A","text":"realized that Mozart was an outstandingly gifted musician."},{"key":"B","text":"said that Mozart was the only person in Europe who understood his music."}]},{"n":11,"stem":"Haydn and Mozart ….","options":[{"key":"A","text":"were both famous when they first met."},{"key":"B","text":"mutually influenced each other."}]},{"n":12,"stem":"Mozart’s …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"symphonies and string quartets show the signs of Haydn’s influence."},{"key":"B","text":"later works use innovations introduced by Haydn."}]},{"n":13,"stem":"The Haydn Quartets …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"is a set of six string quartets."},{"key":"B","text":"was dedicated to Haydn by Mozart."}]},{"n":14,"stem":"Mozart and Haydn …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"were both members of an amateur string quartet."},{"key":"B","text":"co-wrote some chamber music pieces as a result of their practical collaboration."}]},{"n":15,"stem":"Haydn …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"never commented on Mozart publicly before his death."},{"key":"B","text":"became a keen supporter of Mozart’s musical legacy."}]},{"n":16,"stem":"The relationship between Mozart and Haydn …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"became a bit less friendly before Mozart’s death."},{"key":"B","text":"had a strong influence on the history of classical music."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_25maj_fl.mp3","start":640.1,"end":1181.83,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
