 gently to make her breathe."},{"key":"B","text":"gave the baby mouth-to-mouth breathing."}]},{"n":22,"stem":"Colo was …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"taken care of by her mother."},{"key":"B","text":"put in a place specifically built for her."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"The birth of Colo was so sensational that …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the mayor of the city gave cigars to people."},{"key":"B","text":"in 1957 about half a million people visited the zoo to see her."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Colo …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"used her food dish as a hat because she had got used to wearing hats as a baby."},{"key":"B","text":"was recorded on videos crawling and playing with human babies."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Colo …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"had more grandchildren than great-grandchildren."},{"key":"B","text":"always loved to be in the company of other gorillas."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_25okt_fl.mp3","start":1101.17,"end":1795.48,"clip":"hang/e_angol_25okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
