d was really {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":8,"stem":"After the activity the teacher told the students that they are not {{gap}}, they are loved and that they will always {{gap}} each other.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_26okt_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":606.5,"clip":"hang/e_angol_26okt_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
